{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warm yourself by the hearth and enjoy a soothing, atmospheric experience with <i>Fireplace Simulator</i>. Set the mood by adding logs to the fire, chopping new ones when supplies run low, and exploring the room for hidden interactions. Whether you\u2019re unwinding after a long day or looking for a calm backdrop, </strong><strong><i>Fireplace Simulator</i></strong><strong> invites you to relax and enjoy the soft crackle of burning wood.\u00a0 Earn Steam Achievements!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start or Quench the Fire:</strong> Ignite a roaring blaze or let it gently die out at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed Logs to the Fire:</strong> Keep the flames going with a steady supply of wood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cut New Logs:</strong> Run out of logs? No problem\u2014chop more to keep the cozy ambiance alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Change the Weather:</strong> Adjust the elements outside to suit your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Your Surroundings:</strong> Interact with items around the room to discover hidden details and further enhance the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back, relax, and enjoy the peaceful crackle and glow of your own virtual fireplace!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433050/059783095f77da1293fafdf3b09c312a9658081c.jpg"},{"name":"Fire Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433050/059783095f77da1293fafdf3b09c312a9658081c.jpg"},{"name":"Warm Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433050/2fe10bba6f1169ba1dd75b1f3a444e0e5eee8572.jpg"},{"name":"Timber!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati