 chopping new ones when supplies run low, and exploring the room for hidden interactions. Whether you\u2019re unwinding after a long day or looking for a calm backdrop, </strong><strong><i>Fireplace Simulator</i></strong><strong> invites you to relax and enjoy the soft crackle of burning wood.\u00a0 Earn Steam Achievements!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start or Quench the Fire:</strong> Ignite a roaring blaze or let it gently die out at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed Logs to the Fire:</strong> Keep the flames going with a steady supply of wood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cut New Logs:</strong> Run out of logs? No problem\u2014chop more to keep the cozy ambiance alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Change the Weather:</strong> Adjust the elements outside to suit your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Your Surroundings:</strong> Interact with items around the room to discover hidden details and further enhance the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back, relax, and enjoy the peaceful crackle and glow of your own virtual fireplace!</p>","developers":["ForeheadVCR"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433050/000f5261a067faa69fd8c529a474eea5b4bc65f4/header.jpg?t=1745200124","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111476,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111476/movie480.mp4?t=1741309718","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111476/movie_max.mp4?t=1741309718"},"name":"Fireplace Simulator","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse